  "Name": "Red Faction: Battlegrounds",
  "Overview": "Red Faction: Battlegrounds is an arcade game available on Xbox Live Arcade and the PlayStation Store. The game revolves around vehicular combat from a top-down view. It has twenty offline missions arranged in a weakly-ordered campaign as well as multiplayer both local and online. The majority of its vehicles come from Red Faction: Guerrilla, although DLC packs exist for both Red Faction: Armageddon, its sequel, and Red Faction: Origins, the SyFy's channels TV movie.\n\nIt was created by THQ Digital Studios UK, who were the reshuffled group who worked on the Juiced games.",
